1
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,080
"Pure and innocent"!

2
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,680
Sister, what does that mean?

3
00:01:37,759 --> 00:01:38,520
Nothing.

4
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,920
[Why did he put up]

5
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,200
[the paperweight I gave him as a prize?]

6
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:44,440
[Not good.]

7
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,880
[He thinks the prize I offered]

8
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:46,680
[was far too valuable.]

9
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,120
[He's hinting at me.]

10
00:01:49,039 --> 00:01:49,759
[True.]

11
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:51,360
[There are too many people here today.]

12
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:53,080
[So many eyes are watching.]

13
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:54,400
[No.]

14
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,840
[No matter what,]

15
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:56,960
[I must win that paperweight back.]

16
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,400
[Then no one will think]

17
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,120
[I was deliberately giving the Chen family a gift.]

18
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,800
[If I clear my name,]

19
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:03,800
[his name will be cleared too.]

20
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,520
This is a fine piece.

21
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,000
This jade paperweight

22
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,560
looks very valuable.

23
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:10,800
The Chen family truly is wealthy.

24
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:12,800
Wealthy?

25
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,800
Squeezed from the people.

26
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,120
Two realms split by one beam.

27
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,640
The greater bows to the small.

28
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:24,880
Five warriors above,

29
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:26,320
can't beat a pair below.

30
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,240
Guess the object.

31
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,800
What large and small kingdoms?

32
00:02:32,079 --> 00:02:32,800
This object of yours

33
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,280
must be a spirit-writing stick

34
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,160
and a Daoist sand tray.

35
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:36,160
Wrong.

36
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,120
How is that wrong?

37
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,160
Didn't you ask me

38
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:39,200
to find a Daoist for you?

39
00:02:40,079 --> 00:02:41,440
Anyway, your answer is wrong.

40
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,680
Stop being so cryptic.

41
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:51,200
Only green willows may tether a horse.

42
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,040
Only

43
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,200
green... horse...

44
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:02,200
Sunlight over a gushing spring.

45
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,680
Brother Ye,

46
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:07,800
the place in your riddle

47
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,680
isn't somewhere you've been, is it?

48
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,320
Of course it is.

49
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:12,480
But Brother Ye,

50
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,200
you've traveled far and wide.

51
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,520
The places you've been

52
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,760
are places others have never seen.

53
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,240
Isn't it unfair

54
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,680
to set such a riddle?

55
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:21,960
Then I'll withdraw the riddle

56
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:23,040
and stop playing.

57
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:23,640
No, don't.

58
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:25,560
What if someone guesses it?

59
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:26,840
I know the answer.

60
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:29,280
Sunlight over a gushing spring.

61
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:31,040
Is it Yangquan?

62
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:32,640
Correct.

63
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,040
Here.

64
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,320
I'll have someone

65
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,079
send you gunpowder.

66
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,040
Thank you, Lord Ye.

67
00:03:43,079 --> 00:03:44,240
How did you guess it?

68
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:46,840
My ancestral home is in Shanxi.

69
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,600
This guessing game isn't fun at all.

70
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,680
Such a dawdler.

71
00:03:57,880 --> 00:04:00,080
Green willow means the wood radical.

72
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,040
Tethering a horse

73
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,920
must be the other half.

74
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,160
Is it qiang, meaning mast?

75
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,680
Wrong.

76
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,360
Aunt, try again.

77
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
It's chu, meaning pestle.

78
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:16,000
Green willow means the wood radical.

79
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,040
Can tether a horse—

80
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:18,640
Among the earthly branches,

81
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:19,839
Horse corresponds to wu.

82
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,160
So the character is chu.

83
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,280
Miss Gu is correct.

84
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:27,040
How impressive.

85
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,360
Miss Gu is amazing.

86
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:45,200
Large kingdom, small kingdom...

87
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:47,159
I know the answer.

88
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,360
Wrong guess.

89
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,760
Still haven't guessed it.

90
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,960
Isn't that Young Master Wang?

91
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,360
Let's go take a look.

92
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:18,120
Cousin.

93
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,320
What are you doing here?

94
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,920
I just came out of the privy

95
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,840
and lost my way.

96
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:24,520
I wandered into a room

97
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,480
and happened to see this painting on the desk.

98
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,440
It suits my taste perfectly.

99
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:28,880
May I ask who painted it?

100
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:29,960
Could I have it?

101
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,800
This painting has lofty spirit.

102
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:33,800
It looks like Xuruo's work.

103
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,720
I don't think so.

104
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:37,800
Why?

105
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,560
Look at the inscription.

106
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:42,440
"How small the other peaks appear!"

107
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,680
It's Taige style, a formal court script.

108
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:47,040
Precise, powerful, and dignified.

109
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:49,240
Without more than ten years of practice,

110
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:50,840
one couldn't write characters like this.

111
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:53,040
But Young Master Chen

112
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,800
is so young.

113
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:56,400
How could he have written it?

114
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,159
Miss Gu is right.

115
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,120
It was indeed not painted by me.

116
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:05,280
Then what do you think of it?

117
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,560
I think

118
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,560
this painting is not only grand,

119
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,120
but also carries

120
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,040
the force of reaching the summit

121
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,280
and seeing all other peaks below.

122
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,320
It's just...

123
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:19,680
Only what?

124
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,200
It feels somewhat hollow,

125
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,200
not like true feeling.

126
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,280
Well said.

127
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,240
Brother.

128
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,800
Greetings, Mr. Chen.

129
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,440
Uncle.

130
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,800
Lord Ye.

131
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:39,600
Young Master Wang.

132
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:45,000
Then tell me,

133
00:06:46,159 --> 00:06:47,400
who painted

134
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,000
this Ascending the Heights?

135
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:54,360
It should be an older

136
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,760
and highly respected teacher.

137
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,320
Older?

138
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,520
Highly respected?

139
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,000
Uncle.

140
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:04,720
Miss Gu did not mean it.

141
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:08,520
This painting

142
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,200
was done by you?

143
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:11,200
My apologies.

144
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,920
I spoke out of turn.

145
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:13,960
I dared to

146
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:15,400
judge your fine work so rashly.

147
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:16,720
Please forgive me.

148
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,800
I say,

149
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:20,880
since you are here as a guest,

150
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,440
why be so afraid?

151
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,360
It's all right.

152
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,120
Once a painting is completed,

153
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,000
it is meant to be judged.

154
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,360
Miss Gu need not apologize.

155
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,440
Exactly.

156
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:34,000
They say a minister's heart can hold a boat.

157
00:07:34,440 --> 00:07:36,840
Lord Chen is not yet a prime minister,

158
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,360
but he's nearly in the Secretariat.

159
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,960
So, half a boat at least.

160
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:42,560
But for a dignified prime minister

161
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:44,159
to hide behind a door and eavesdrop—

162
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:45,560
that lacks grace.

163
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:48,560
Someone wanted to critique my painting.

164
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,000
It is only natural

165
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:51,720
that I wished to hear it.

166
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,320
So it was Lord Chen's painting.

167
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,080
Then may I have it?

168
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,600
Since Young Master Wang likes it,

169
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,000
take it.

170
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,600
Thank you, Lord Chen.

171
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,760
Actually, I came to find Lord Ye.

172
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:08,160
Lord Ye is of noble character,

173
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:11,000
and serves as the Crown Prince's reader.

174
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,600
It is getting late.

175
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,160
I fear

176
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,040
he should return.

177
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,200
I still have a riddle unsolved.

178
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,240
I'm not going back.

179
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,320
What kind of riddle

180
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,720
could stump Lord Ye?

181
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:31,880
Uncle.

182
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:34,240
It is a riddle from Miss Gu.

183
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,960
It has stumped everyone.

184
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:37,799
Let's hear it, then.

185
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,360
Two realms split by one beam.

186
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:42,120
The greater bows to the small.

187
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:44,080
Five warriors above,

188
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,960
can't beat a pair below.

189
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,040
Guess the object.

190
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:48,760
Isn't that an abacus?

191
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,280
You actually guessed it.

192
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:54,040
I'll have the prize sent

193
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:55,080
to you at once.

194
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,800
You call that hard?

195
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:58,320
What?

196
00:08:59,240 --> 00:08:59,960
With so many of you here,

197
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:00,840
no one guessed it?

198
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:15,320
You all...

199
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:47,360
Uncle.

200
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:51,880
Earlier I went to visit Fourth Uncle.

201
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,360
He refused to see me.

202
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:55,240
Later, Grandmother came as well.

203
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,440
Fourth Uncle still would not see her.

204
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:57,960
Only after Grandmother said

205
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,080
she would summon a physician

206
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,400
did he open the gate.

207
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,560
Let's not speak of him.

208
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,760
For next spring's imperial exam,

209
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,200
do you plan to sit for it?

210
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:09,360
That is my intention.

211
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,120
I plan to return to the academy tomorrow

212
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:12,640
and shut myself in to study.

213
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:14,160
Good.

214
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,840
Tomorrow, take your essays

215
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,360
to Minister Chang Tinglan's residence

216
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:21,320
and ask him for guidance.

217
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:22,680
I have already spoken with him.

218
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:23,760
From now on,

219
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,040
every ten days,

220
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,120
he will review an essay for you.

221
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:28,920
Lord Chang?

222
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,520
But he is not a great scholar.

223
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:40,000
Yes, Third Uncle.

224
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:41,000
Go.

225
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,000
I think

226
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:59,280
this painting is not only grand,

227
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,040
but also carries

228
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:02,960
the force of reaching the summit

229
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:05,840
and seeing all other peaks below.

230
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:10,080
It's just...

231
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:12,840
It feels somewhat hollow,

232
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,920
not like true feeling.

233
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,160
True feeling.

234
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:17,760
Miss,

235
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:20,440
incense burns so strongly at Baoxiang Temple.

236
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,600
Yes. Today is the Double Ninth Festival.

237
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:24,080
Not everyone is here to pray.

238
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:26,040
Some may be here to climb heights.

239
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,720
Let's hurry forward.

240
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,880
After praying for Grandmother,

241
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:31,000
we can come back and look around.

242
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:31,960
Yes, miss.

243
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:33,600
Look.

244
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:57,560
Autumn shadows fill the river; wild geese take wing.

245
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:01,520
With wine and friends, I climb the emerald height.

246
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:04,160
What a pity.

247
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,680
I didn't bring good wine.

248
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,440
A rare day off

249
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:09,160
should be spent resting properly.

250
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,000
Why insist on climbing a mountain?

251
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,600
Uncle, you can't run.

252
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,080
I secretly brought you here to climb.

253
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,200
If anything happens to you,

254
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,680
my mother will skin me alive.

255
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:26,640
Uncle.

256
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:27,560
Uncle.

257
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:28,480
Uncle.

258
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:28,880
My lord.

259
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:30,200
Uncle, don't scare me.

260
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:31,600
Uncle.

261
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,000
My lord.

262
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,000
Bodhisattva above,

263
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:36,600
please protect Grandmother.

264
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:38,080
May she be safe

265
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:39,400
and free from disaster.

266
00:13:58,160 --> 00:13:58,680
Miss.

267
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:01,480
Isn't that Lord Ye?

268
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:02,760
Go see.

269
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,200
Cousin Jinzhao.

270
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:06,600
What happened to Lord Ye?

271
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:08,040
His heart may be acting up.

272
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:11,200
If you know it is his heart ailment,

273
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,400
do you have medicine with you?

274
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,960
He usually keeps medicine on him.

275
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,600
But he happened to be off duty today,

276
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,600
so he didn't bring any.

277
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,040
Guard Li went down

278
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:18,760
to call a physician.

279
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:20,320
I understand.

280
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:22,200
A heart ailment cannot wait.

281
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:30,400
No.

282
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:31,440
We can't wait for Guard Li.

283
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:32,800
Qingpu.

284
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,480
Press his Tanzhong pressure point.

285
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:35,360
Yes.

286
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:36,520
Please move aside.

287
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,400
Will this work?

288
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:49,760
What are you doing?

289
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,000
If you harm him,

290
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,080
our whole family could die.

291
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,400
But we can't just watch him die.

292
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:54,200
Let go. But...

293
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,560
No buts.

294
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,520
He moved.

295
00:15:11,400 --> 00:15:12,760
Miss, it's working.

296
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:13,960
It really is.

297
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:28,960
It's you.

298
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,120
You're awake.

299
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,360
Thank heaven.

300
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,360
Don't move.

301
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:35,320
Bodhisattva bless us.

302
00:15:35,560 --> 00:15:36,320
Do you still

303
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,560
feel unwell anywhere?

304
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:40,520
Yes.

305
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:41,520
Where?

306
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,040
My hand.

307
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:45,080
My hand is trapped.

308
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:11,680
On the road, go slower if you must,

309
00:16:11,800 --> 00:16:12,680
but don't jostle him.

310
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:13,720
Yes.

311
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:15,800
And you too.

312
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:16,920
Don't move around.

313
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,320
Even after taking medicine,

314
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,000
you should rest for several days.

315
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:23,480
Why such a nag at your age?

316
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:24,600
What did you say?

317
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:27,120
I said,

318
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:29,440
you're so young, yet such a nag,

319
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:31,440
like an old nanny.

320
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,120
Lift the sedan.

321
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,480
Let's go too.

322
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:57,920
The Marquis of Changxing leads the military lords.

323
00:16:58,400 --> 00:17:00,760
Ye Xian is his heir.

324
00:17:01,400 --> 00:17:03,240
With a heart ailment, he cannot take up arms.

325
00:17:04,119 --> 00:17:05,440
And he is the marquisate's only son.

326
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:08,119
If the military heir cannot fight,

327
00:17:08,280 --> 00:17:09,440
he has no future.

328
00:17:10,599 --> 00:17:11,280
Yes.

329
00:17:11,839 --> 00:17:13,520
A heart ailment is hard to cure.

330
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:23,520
Miss,

331
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:24,599
you are amazing.

332
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:30,960
It is getting late.

333
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,040
We've been out for half a day.

334
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:33,120
We should go back.

335
00:17:33,840 --> 00:17:34,320
Let's go.

336
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,760
When can we pass?

337
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,080
I still have things to do.

338
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:49,320
I need to go home.

339
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,520
Miss, I'll ask.

340
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:54,920
When will they let us through?

341
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:56,200
Can't someone give us an answer?

342
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,440
Say something.

343
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,240
When can we pass?

344
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:09,600
Miss, I heard

345
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:11,280
a noble has come to Baoxiang Temple to offer incense.

346
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:12,760
The whole mountain is sealed off.

347
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:14,400
Offer incense?

348
00:18:14,800 --> 00:18:15,960
That's clearly a lie.

349
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:17,960
People offer incense early, not late.

350
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,120
It is already afternoon.

351
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:20,560
Who comes to offer incense now?

352
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:22,600
What rotten luck.

353
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:23,840
Had I known,

354
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:25,200
I would have gone down with Ye Xian.

355
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,520
When I climbed the tree earlier,

356
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:30,840
I saw on that hill

357
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:31,760
another path.

358
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:33,280
Why don't I go scout it first?

359
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:34,200
If it can be used,

360
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:35,040
I'll come back for you.

361
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:35,960
All right.

362
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:36,960
Then wait for me.

363
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:50,960
Let us through.

364
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:52,520
We need to go down.

365
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:53,680
Exactly.

366
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:55,120
We need to go down.

367
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,920
Why isn't Qingpu back yet?

368
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:06,000
Could something have happened?

369
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:19,960
Is this the path Qingpu mentioned?

370
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,480
Why is there no one here?

371
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:35,920
Why isn't there a soul here?

372
00:19:57,160 --> 00:19:57,920
Help!

373
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:00,360
Mr. Chen!

374
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,080
Protect the Crown Prince.

375
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:19,080
Yes.

376
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:42,600
So the man that day

377
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:44,000
really was him.

378
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:46,280
Damned Crown Prince.

379
00:21:46,360 --> 00:21:47,560
Die!

380
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:24,640
Can you still stand?

381
00:22:56,080 --> 00:22:56,760
Were you frightened?

382
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,160
What?

383
00:23:07,640 --> 00:23:08,240
You mean

384
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:09,760
Jinzhao is still on the mountain?

385
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:10,800
Yes.

386
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:12,680
I found a path in the back hills

387
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:14,040
and planned to return for Miss.

388
00:23:14,320 --> 00:23:15,920
But who would have thought the way back

389
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:16,960
was also sealed off?

390
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:18,360
So I came back first

391
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:19,360
and inform you all.

392
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:21,240
It will soon be dark.

393
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,720
Please give me more people, Madam,

394
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:24,120
to go back up the mountain and find Miss.

395
00:23:24,440 --> 00:23:25,120
Good child.

396
00:23:25,560 --> 00:23:26,760
You may have as many as you need.

397
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:28,240
Take my tally at once

398
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:29,080
and summon people.

399
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:30,000
Come, Nanny Zhao.

400
00:23:32,760 --> 00:23:33,480
Thank you, Madam.

401
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:34,680
Go.

402
00:23:38,120 --> 00:23:38,960
In my view,

403
00:23:39,280 --> 00:23:39,920
Jinzhao

404
00:23:40,320 --> 00:23:41,480
is just too playful.

405
00:23:44,040 --> 00:23:45,280
Jinzhao is not that kind of person.

406
00:23:47,760 --> 00:23:48,640
What are we to do?

407
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:55,920
Will you confess or not?

408
00:23:58,760 --> 00:23:59,760
Still refusing?

409
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:12,680
I've already seen him

410
00:24:12,680 --> 00:24:13,840
kill people twice.

411
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:15,760
Will he kill me to silence me?

412
00:24:27,200 --> 00:24:28,200
Greetings, Mr. Chen.

413
00:24:33,600 --> 00:24:34,240
Mr. Chen.

414
00:24:34,440 --> 00:24:35,720
I truly heard nothing.

415
00:24:35,840 --> 00:24:36,880
I saw nothing.

416
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:37,440
I promise.

417
00:24:37,440 --> 00:24:38,600
I won't say a single word.

418
00:24:39,040 --> 00:24:39,640
Please.

419
00:24:40,040 --> 00:24:41,760
Please spare my life.

420
00:24:47,120 --> 00:24:48,520
Today's matter is gravely serious.

421
00:24:48,800 --> 00:24:49,760
If word gets out,

422
00:24:50,040 --> 00:24:51,280
who knows how many people

423
00:24:51,520 --> 00:24:53,040
it could bring death upon them.

424
00:25:02,800 --> 00:25:03,840
This is...

425
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:07,720
Take it.

426
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:09,960
I cannot protect you otherwise.

427
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,160
It's poison.

428
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:14,640
Mr. Chen.

429
00:25:15,040 --> 00:25:15,760
I won't breathe

430
00:25:15,760 --> 00:25:16,800
a single word of it.

431
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:17,760
Otherwise,

432
00:25:18,120 --> 00:25:19,000
may lightning strike me.

433
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:23,440
No need for oaths.

434
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:24,720
Take the medicine.

435
00:25:25,280 --> 00:25:26,520
Then I will believe you.

436
00:25:27,080 --> 00:25:27,960
Mr. Chen.

437
00:25:28,560 --> 00:25:29,640
When I came today,

438
00:25:29,800 --> 00:25:31,240
many people saw me.

439
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:32,600
My maid and I

440
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,080
were together at first,

441
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:36,040
but then we got separated.

442
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:36,880
I imagine by now

443
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:38,080
she has already gone back.

444
00:25:38,360 --> 00:25:39,000
If she finds

445
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:39,960
she cannot find me,

446
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:41,600
she will surely send word when she returns.

447
00:25:42,120 --> 00:25:44,000
She may even report it to officials.

448
00:25:44,800 --> 00:25:45,400
Right.

449
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:46,800
On the way,

450
00:25:47,160 --> 00:25:48,640
Lord Ye saw me too.

451
00:25:48,880 --> 00:25:50,440
If he suddenly learns I died,

452
00:25:50,560 --> 00:25:51,960
he will certainly ask about it.

453
00:25:52,280 --> 00:25:53,280
So what?

454
00:25:53,680 --> 00:25:54,720
If too many people ask,

455
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:56,160
then everyone will know.

456
00:25:57,600 --> 00:25:58,400
So killing me

457
00:25:58,600 --> 00:25:59,800
would do more harm than good.

458
00:26:00,280 --> 00:26:02,200
And this is sacred Buddhist ground.

459
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:03,320
Killing here is unlucky.

460
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:04,400
Please, Mr. Chen.

461
00:26:04,760 --> 00:26:06,280
Why not spare my life?

462
00:26:07,120 --> 00:26:08,600
Saving a life earns great merit.

463
00:26:08,840 --> 00:26:10,560
The dead are the only truly reliable ones.

464
00:26:11,560 --> 00:26:12,560
When today's matter is done,

465
00:26:13,080 --> 00:26:14,680
I will naturally protect your grandmother

466
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:15,760
and the Ji family

467
00:26:16,280 --> 00:26:17,480
and keep them safe.

468
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:45,960
Lord Chen.

469
00:26:46,840 --> 00:26:48,200
Why must you do this?

470
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:50,400
Since you say the girl is one of us,

471
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:51,800
she can naturally be trusted.

472
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:53,600
Trustworthy or not,

473
00:26:54,600 --> 00:26:56,640
I trust only what I test myself.

474
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:00,600
How did it go on your side?

475
00:27:01,520 --> 00:27:02,440
He confessed.

476
00:27:03,840 --> 00:27:04,760
Let's talk inside.

477
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:12,720
After all that questioning,

478
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:14,520
he only said the leader's surname is Xiao.

479
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:16,120
Every time they met,

480
00:27:16,120 --> 00:27:16,880
he wore a veiled hat,

481
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:18,000
his face was hidden.

482
00:27:19,800 --> 00:27:21,160
From his bearing,

483
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:22,080
he seemed like a scholar.

484
00:27:22,360 --> 00:27:23,240
He spent freely.

485
00:27:24,720 --> 00:27:26,680
When one of their men died before,

486
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:28,440
the compensation money

487
00:27:28,440 --> 00:27:29,760
was a full five hundred taels.

488
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:31,240
That is why each of them

489
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,920
was willing to die for him.

490
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:34,720
Surname Xiao?

491
00:27:36,880 --> 00:27:38,400
Could it be Xiao Qishan?

492
00:27:39,760 --> 00:27:40,880
Wasn't he once an adviser

493
00:27:40,880 --> 00:27:42,000
to the late Prince Chengqing?

494
00:27:42,760 --> 00:27:44,080
Back then, Prince Chengqing

495
00:27:44,080 --> 00:27:45,600
obeyed that man in everything.

496
00:27:46,080 --> 00:27:48,320
After Prince Chengqing's rebellion failed,

497
00:27:48,760 --> 00:27:50,200
The Marquis killed the prince,

498
00:27:50,480 --> 00:27:52,400
and that adviser vanished.

499
00:27:52,840 --> 00:27:54,520
This time, the news of the Crown Prince leaving the palace

500
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:55,240
was leaked by us

501
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:56,760
to Prince Glorian.

502
00:27:58,120 --> 00:27:59,480
But Prince Glorian actually used

503
00:27:59,480 --> 00:28:01,120
one of Prince Chengqing's former strategists.

504
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:02,680
That means...

505
00:28:02,840 --> 00:28:04,000
It means Prince Glorian

506
00:28:04,560 --> 00:28:05,920
has always brooded

507
00:28:06,320 --> 00:28:07,720
over Prince Chengqing's death.

508
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:13,080
It seems Prince Glorian

509
00:28:13,360 --> 00:28:14,760
is plotting something big.

510
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:16,600
Lord Chen,

511
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:18,520
you must be extra careful.

512
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,760
Same to you.

513
00:28:23,080 --> 00:28:23,800
Lord Chen.

514
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:26,680
We are in the same boat now.

515
00:28:27,840 --> 00:28:29,400
Back then, the late Prince Chengqing's rebellion

516
00:28:29,760 --> 00:28:31,960
left the Criminal Justice Office in ruins.

517
00:28:32,520 --> 00:28:33,560
If the Chief Councilor

518
00:28:33,720 --> 00:28:35,400
had not valued us,

519
00:28:35,600 --> 00:28:36,360
how could we have

520
00:28:36,360 --> 00:28:37,640
to handle such an important case?

521
00:28:38,480 --> 00:28:39,280
In the future,

522
00:28:39,840 --> 00:28:41,960
I hope you will support me, Lord Chen.

523
00:28:42,320 --> 00:28:43,920
You and I both serve our teacher.

524
00:28:44,360 --> 00:28:45,240
We should

525
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:47,000
work as one.

526
00:29:03,560 --> 00:29:04,280
Stop pretending.

527
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:05,160
Get up.

528
00:29:14,680 --> 00:29:15,800
Greetings, Mr. Chen.

529
00:29:16,120 --> 00:29:17,080
Rise and speak.

530
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:23,800
It's over now.

531
00:29:27,680 --> 00:29:28,640
When today's matter is done,

532
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:30,800
I will naturally protect your grandmother

533
00:29:30,800 --> 00:29:31,920
and the Ji family

534
00:29:32,320 --> 00:29:33,600
and keep them safe.

535
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:47,800
Thank you for saving me just now, Mr. Chen.

536
00:29:59,720 --> 00:30:00,320
What is it?

537
00:30:00,560 --> 00:30:01,320
What are you looking at?

538
00:30:03,560 --> 00:30:04,800
I'm looking at you.

539
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:06,240
You seem

540
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:07,520
different from before.

541
00:30:09,120 --> 00:30:11,360
I mean that time I set fire to the storeroom

542
00:30:11,600 --> 00:30:13,280
and snatched your lantern.

543
00:30:14,600 --> 00:30:16,040
Why didn't you say so the last two times?

544
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:19,520
Because I didn't dare.

545
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:21,200
This time, I dare.

546
00:30:21,720 --> 00:30:23,400
You just saved my life.

547
00:30:26,800 --> 00:30:28,120
You were too afraid to say it

548
00:30:28,120 --> 00:30:29,240
because you saw me kill?

549
00:30:30,360 --> 00:30:32,160
You only killed when you had no choice.

550
00:30:33,120 --> 00:30:34,200
How am I different?

551
00:30:37,280 --> 00:30:38,360
I can't quite say.

552
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:42,240
It reminds me

553
00:30:42,240 --> 00:30:44,000
of when I lived in Tongzhou.

554
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:45,160
There was

555
00:30:45,520 --> 00:30:46,760
a young servant named Gou

556
00:30:46,760 --> 00:30:48,080
who played with me often.

557
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:50,000
We often played together.

558
00:30:50,800 --> 00:30:52,640
But one year he returned to his hometown.

559
00:30:52,800 --> 00:30:53,720
After he came back,

560
00:30:53,840 --> 00:30:55,200
his whole nature changed.

561
00:30:55,480 --> 00:30:57,560
He became quiet

562
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:59,240
and stopped playing with me.

563
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:00,680
He only begged Grandmother

564
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:02,040
to send him to Suzhou

565
00:31:02,240 --> 00:31:03,440
as an apprentice in a shop.

566
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:06,480
I only learned later

567
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:08,920
that during that month,

568
00:31:09,080 --> 00:31:10,280
his father had died.

569
00:31:12,120 --> 00:31:13,800
I shall watch from heaven

570
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:15,960
whether Great Yan

571
00:31:15,960 --> 00:31:17,760
under your protection, Chen Yanyun,

572
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:21,160
can prosper without end.

573
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:40,080
I'm not saying you are like him.

574
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:41,320
What I mean is—

575
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:42,680
I understand.

576
00:31:48,120 --> 00:31:48,640
Sit.

577
00:31:54,600 --> 00:31:56,080
My ancestral home is also in Tongzhou.

578
00:31:56,440 --> 00:31:57,440
Even now,

579
00:31:57,840 --> 00:31:59,040
your grandmother still manages it.

580
00:32:04,280 --> 00:32:05,840
I wonder when

581
00:32:05,840 --> 00:32:07,320
I can return to Tongzhou.

582
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:09,440
What is it?

583
00:32:10,160 --> 00:32:11,200
Do you dislike the capital?

584
00:32:12,960 --> 00:32:14,000
I don't like the capital.

585
00:32:14,120 --> 00:32:15,320
The capital isn't fun at all.

586
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:16,680
Unlike Tongzhou,

587
00:32:18,800 --> 00:32:19,760
there are docks,

588
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:20,880
temple fairs,

589
00:32:21,320 --> 00:32:22,360
and book markets.

590
00:32:23,320 --> 00:32:25,120
The capital has those too.

591
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:26,800
The capital is different.

592
00:32:27,040 --> 00:32:27,960
The capital has too many rules.

593
00:32:28,120 --> 00:32:29,320
Many entertainments are forbidden.

594
00:32:30,160 --> 00:32:30,920
For example,

595
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:31,920
in Tongzhou,

596
00:32:32,320 --> 00:32:34,040
during New Year, we held temple fairs.

597
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:35,360
Tongzhou's wealthy merchants

598
00:32:35,360 --> 00:32:36,480
take turns hiring opera troupes

599
00:32:36,480 --> 00:32:37,760
to perform at the fairs.

600
00:32:38,240 --> 00:32:39,960
And I loved iron-flower shows.

601
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,200
So every year, Grandmother

602
00:32:41,440 --> 00:32:41,960
hired performers

603
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,320
hired iron-flower performers to perform.

604
00:32:43,480 --> 00:32:44,560
It was so beautiful.

605
00:32:45,720 --> 00:32:47,400
But the capital forbids it.

606
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:48,920
Forget iron-flower shows.

607
00:32:49,160 --> 00:32:50,920
I heard that since the year before last,

608
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:53,040
even Aoshan lantern displays are banned.

609
00:32:56,280 --> 00:32:57,240
Molten-iron fireworks?

610
00:33:00,760 --> 00:33:01,480
But

611
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:04,080
Fire and fireworks can easily start a blaze.

612
00:33:10,520 --> 00:33:11,320
Miss.

613
00:33:12,040 --> 00:33:14,160
Miss, miss.

614
00:33:14,520 --> 00:33:16,000
You finally came down.

615
00:33:16,080 --> 00:33:17,920
I was worried to death.

616
00:33:19,120 --> 00:33:20,040
Are you all right?

617
00:33:20,600 --> 00:33:22,000
Look, I'm fine.

618
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:22,920
Thank you.

619
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:24,240
Let's go home. Come.

620
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:40,520
Did you bump or hurt yourself?

621
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,800
I heard you encountered a noble.

622
00:33:43,280 --> 00:33:44,560
Did they trouble you?

623
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:47,360
I'm fine.

624
00:33:47,720 --> 00:33:49,200
I just returned a bit late.

625
00:33:49,520 --> 00:33:50,880
Only after the noble left

626
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:52,320
was I allowed down the mountain.

627
00:33:54,280 --> 00:33:55,720
Which palace was that noble from

628
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:56,480
to put on such airs?

629
00:33:57,360 --> 00:33:58,680
I wouldn't know.

630
00:33:59,320 --> 00:34:00,680
As long as they didn't trouble you.

631
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:02,160
Hurry back and rest.

632
00:34:02,280 --> 00:34:03,320
You've had a long day.

633
00:34:13,080 --> 00:34:14,600
What kind of attitude was that?

634
00:34:20,880 --> 00:34:22,040
What are you thinking about, Miss?

635
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:25,320
The night before my coming-of-age,

636
00:34:25,920 --> 00:34:27,040
I remember it all.

637
00:34:28,120 --> 00:34:29,080
The person I saw that night

638
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:30,080
was Mr. Chen.

639
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:32,560
What should we do?

640
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:34,840
Will Mr. Chen turn against you?

641
00:34:38,080 --> 00:34:38,960
Speaking of that,

642
00:34:39,239 --> 00:34:40,239
there is something

643
00:34:40,760 --> 00:34:41,679
I need you to do.

644
00:34:42,679 --> 00:34:43,639
Please tell me.

645
00:34:44,560 --> 00:34:45,639
I have an old acquaintance,

646
00:34:45,679 --> 00:34:46,320
surnamed Nie.

647
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:48,719
His wife and daughter are in the capital.

648
00:34:49,040 --> 00:34:49,960
Help me settle them properly.

649
00:34:51,040 --> 00:34:52,120
I cannot show myself.

650
00:34:53,120 --> 00:34:54,040
When you find her,

651
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:55,280
don't mention me.

652
00:34:58,120 --> 00:34:59,200
He probably won't.

653
00:35:00,160 --> 00:35:01,640
He ordered me to do something for him.

654
00:35:03,560 --> 00:35:04,160
Right.

655
00:35:05,040 --> 00:35:05,760
Tomorrow morning,

656
00:35:06,200 --> 00:35:07,240
go find Shopkeeper Luo.

657
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:09,480
Ask him to choose several

658
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:11,400
marionettes.

659
00:35:12,200 --> 00:35:13,000
I need them.

660
00:35:19,720 --> 00:35:20,920
In this capital review,

661
00:35:21,080 --> 00:35:22,000
we found

662
00:35:22,320 --> 00:35:24,800
officials such as Zheng Tuo,

663
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:25,800
of the Shanxi Bureau,

664
00:35:25,800 --> 00:35:26,880
were found unfit—

665
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:28,760
376 in all.

666
00:35:29,160 --> 00:35:30,000
Among them,

667
00:35:30,320 --> 00:35:32,640
37 were dismissed,

668
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:34,920
42 were demoted,

669
00:35:35,720 --> 00:35:37,560
16 were transferred out,

670
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:40,160
and 28 were formally reprimanded.

671
00:35:43,280 --> 00:35:44,520
The capital officials

672
00:35:45,200 --> 00:35:49,000
number 1,364 in all.

673
00:35:50,240 --> 00:35:53,080
Yet 376 were found unfit.

674
00:35:53,720 --> 00:35:56,120
Many military nobles did not even attend.

675
00:35:57,080 --> 00:35:57,960
The scene

676
00:35:59,160 --> 00:36:01,240
was truly brutal.

677
00:36:01,640 --> 00:36:02,800
So harsh,

678
00:36:03,080 --> 00:36:04,560
yet Master was rated competent.

679
00:36:04,960 --> 00:36:06,000
This shows how strong

680
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:06,800
his reputation is.

681
00:36:07,080 --> 00:36:08,000
One can only say

682
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:10,120
it was luck.

683
00:36:12,520 --> 00:36:14,440
I must also thank Lord Lin

684
00:36:15,200 --> 00:36:17,760
for saying in public he was not close to me.

685
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:23,040
I called him Teacher for so many years,

686
00:36:23,880 --> 00:36:26,120
and he repaid me with "not close."

687
00:36:27,560 --> 00:36:28,400
Yet in the blink of an eye,

688
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,160
he himself got into trouble.

689
00:36:33,040 --> 00:36:33,760
Indeed.

690
00:36:34,120 --> 00:36:35,880
Heaven sees all.

691
00:36:42,040 --> 00:36:42,960
Master.

692
00:36:43,120 --> 00:36:44,400
I have a favor to ask of you.

693
00:36:44,600 --> 00:36:46,440
If you mean managing the household,

694
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:47,320
then no.

695
00:36:47,640 --> 00:36:48,760
What happened before

696
00:36:48,960 --> 00:36:50,080
was only a few days ago.

697
00:36:50,320 --> 00:36:50,920
Right now,

698
00:36:51,520 --> 00:36:53,160
returning household authority to you

699
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:54,560
cannot be justified.

700
00:36:54,680 --> 00:36:56,160
It isn't about household authority.

701
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:58,360
Lan comes of age next year.

702
00:36:59,080 --> 00:37:00,760
She was raised before your eyes.

703
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:02,600
Her coming-of-age ceremony

704
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:04,680
should also be decent, shouldn't it?

705
00:37:05,400 --> 00:37:07,640
This is not the time for that.

706
00:37:07,640 --> 00:37:09,040
In any case, that is next year.

707
00:37:09,680 --> 00:37:10,560
We'll discuss it next year.

708
00:37:12,480 --> 00:37:13,600
I just remembered

709
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:15,360
there are matters in the front courtyard.

710
00:37:16,400 --> 00:37:17,040
That's all for now.

711
00:37:23,560 --> 00:37:24,200
Miss.

712
00:37:24,600 --> 00:37:25,520
These are

713
00:37:25,520 --> 00:37:26,920
the three marionettes you wanted.

714
00:37:28,040 --> 00:37:29,120
They are quite exquisite.

715
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:29,760
Yes.

716
00:37:29,880 --> 00:37:30,800
We found

717
00:37:30,880 --> 00:37:32,240
the best craftsmen to make them.

718
00:37:33,240 --> 00:37:34,320
Thank you, Uncle Ping.

719
00:37:35,400 --> 00:37:36,520
Then let's go now.

720
00:37:43,040 --> 00:37:43,800
What happened?

721
00:37:44,120 --> 00:37:44,720
Don't panic.

722
00:37:45,680 --> 00:37:46,240
Miss.

723
00:37:46,600 --> 00:37:48,000
to notify Madam Nie.

724
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:49,840
to notify Madam Nie.

725
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:51,960
I had just reached Fentiao Alley

726
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:53,480
I ran into people snatching things.

727
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:55,480
I ran into a group looting.

728
00:37:55,480 --> 00:37:56,680
the clansmen of Madam Nie's late husband.

729
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:58,080
They kept saying

730
00:37:58,280 --> 00:37:59,880
the property belongs to the clan

731
00:38:00,200 --> 00:38:01,200
The property belongs to the clan

732
00:38:01,200 --> 00:38:01,960
and must be taken back.

733
00:38:02,200 --> 00:38:03,280
They also said their second brother

734
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:04,800
was heir to a hereditary title,

735
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:06,160
called...

736
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:07,960
the hereditary rank Yunqiwei.

737
00:38:08,280 --> 00:38:09,800
For speaking wildly before His Majesty,

738
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:11,000
he was beaten to death.

739
00:38:11,520 --> 00:38:13,240
so they blamed Madam Nie for bringing misfortune.

740
00:38:13,720 --> 00:38:14,760
Nie Fengming.

741
00:38:15,360 --> 00:38:15,960
Miss.

742
00:38:16,240 --> 00:38:18,680
Could Mr. Chen's friend be...

743
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:20,240
Go on.

744
00:38:20,560 --> 00:38:21,080
Yes.

745
00:38:21,720 --> 00:38:22,720
Though I didn't understand

746
00:38:22,720 --> 00:38:23,720
what they meant,

747
00:38:23,880 --> 00:38:24,600
I knew

748
00:38:24,800 --> 00:38:25,640
Madam Nie

749
00:38:25,640 --> 00:38:26,560
Madam Nie

750
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:28,280
was the person you wanted found.

751
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:29,440
So

752
00:38:29,440 --> 00:38:30,360
I placed them

753
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:31,400
at the silk shop.

754
00:38:32,120 --> 00:38:33,120
If I overstepped,

755
00:38:33,320 --> 00:38:34,440
please punish me.

756
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:36,920
Punish you for what?

757
00:38:37,960 --> 00:38:39,600
For doing the job too well?

758
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:42,320
Thank you, Miss.

759
00:38:42,800 --> 00:38:43,360
Let's go.

760
00:38:43,360 --> 00:38:44,160
To the silk shop.

761
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:04,120
May I ask, are you Miss Gu?

762
00:39:04,520 --> 00:39:05,240
Yes.

763
00:39:06,680 --> 00:39:08,120
Thank you, Miss Gu's servant

764
00:39:08,120 --> 00:39:09,320
for helping me out of trouble.

765
00:39:09,760 --> 00:39:10,520
Please, no need.

766
00:39:10,840 --> 00:39:11,880
Please rise.

767
00:39:13,720 --> 00:39:15,920
Miss Gu and I are strangers.

768
00:39:16,200 --> 00:39:17,200
May I ask

769
00:39:17,200 --> 00:39:19,080
why you sent someone to find me?

770
00:39:19,440 --> 00:39:20,520
Here is the matter.

771
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:22,160
I have a cousin.

772
00:39:22,160 --> 00:39:23,120
Some years ago in the capital,

773
00:39:23,120 --> 00:39:24,320
while doing business,

774
00:39:24,640 --> 00:39:26,040
he received Lord Nie's help.

775
00:39:26,720 --> 00:39:27,840
This cousin of mine

776
00:39:28,080 --> 00:39:29,640
heard I was coming to the capital,

777
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:32,000
so he asked me to visit you.

778
00:39:32,440 --> 00:39:33,360
Who would have thought

779
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:35,480
we'd happen upon a disturbance?

780
00:39:35,880 --> 00:39:36,800
Help?

781
00:39:37,360 --> 00:39:38,040
Yes.

782
00:39:38,640 --> 00:39:39,720
This man

783
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:41,520
was always eager to do public good

784
00:39:41,520 --> 00:39:42,640
and help others.

785
00:39:43,080 --> 00:39:44,280
But he forgot

786
00:39:45,120 --> 00:39:46,480
those who needed his help most

787
00:39:47,320 --> 00:39:48,800
were his own family.

788
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:55,320
You must be Xiangyun.

789
00:39:57,960 --> 00:39:59,360
This cousin of mine said

790
00:39:59,680 --> 00:40:01,960
this month is Xiangyun's birthday.

791
00:40:02,320 --> 00:40:03,000
So

792
00:40:03,040 --> 00:40:04,600
he specially asked me to bring gifts.

793
00:40:08,400 --> 00:40:09,920
String puppets.

794
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:12,080
Are all these for me?

795
00:40:12,720 --> 00:40:14,360
Yes, all for you.

796
00:40:14,720 --> 00:40:15,560
Do you like them?

797
00:40:15,720 --> 00:40:16,560
I do.

798
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:19,240
Mother, may I take them?

799
00:40:22,520 --> 00:40:23,600
Since they are for you,

800
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:24,880
take them and play.

801
00:40:26,360 --> 00:40:27,480
Xiangyun, come.

802
00:40:27,720 --> 00:40:28,280
Come with sister.

803
00:40:28,280 --> 00:40:28,720
All right.

804
00:40:29,080 --> 00:40:30,160
Thank you, sister.

805
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:31,680
Miss,

806
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:34,000
I'll bring more tea and snacks.

807
00:40:35,920 --> 00:40:36,920
Please sit.

808
00:40:38,880 --> 00:40:39,840
This is wound medicine.

809
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:41,920
Take it home and apply it to your wounds.

810
00:40:43,600 --> 00:40:44,920
Thank you, Miss Gu.

811
00:40:45,720 --> 00:40:48,120
This time, disaster befell him.

812
00:40:48,440 --> 00:40:49,200
The court

813
00:40:49,200 --> 00:40:50,600
pitied us, orphan and widow,

814
00:40:50,600 --> 00:40:51,760
and spared us punishment.

815
00:40:52,360 --> 00:40:53,760
But those clansmen

816
00:40:54,040 --> 00:40:54,920
have instead set their eyes

817
00:40:54,920 --> 00:40:56,600
on my late husband's possessions.

818
00:40:56,960 --> 00:40:58,800
After all is said and done,

819
00:40:59,240 --> 00:41:00,400
it is my fault.

820
00:41:00,840 --> 00:41:02,080
I was blind.

821
00:41:02,680 --> 00:41:03,560
I married

822
00:41:03,560 --> 00:41:05,840
such a heartless, short-lived wretch.

823
00:41:07,320 --> 00:41:08,080
Mother.

824
00:41:08,080 --> 00:41:09,640
Father was a good man.

825
00:41:09,760 --> 00:41:11,200
He is not a ghost.

826
00:41:11,600 --> 00:41:13,200
Your father left us both behind

827
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:14,640
and went off to die alone.

828
00:41:15,080 --> 00:41:16,440
Yet you still speak for him.

829
00:41:16,760 --> 00:41:18,400
Father did it for righteousness.

830
00:41:18,400 --> 00:41:19,360
For his righteousness,

831
00:41:19,480 --> 00:41:20,920
he sacrificed both our lives

832
00:41:21,280 --> 00:41:22,920
he sacrificed both our lives

833
00:41:23,400 --> 00:41:24,960
and made us suffer like this.

834
00:41:25,520 --> 00:41:27,320
What kind of righteousness is that?

835
00:41:27,800 --> 00:41:29,160
I don't feel it's suffering.

836
00:41:29,400 --> 00:41:30,840
That day Father said

837
00:41:31,040 --> 00:41:32,240
after he died,

838
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:34,560
I must still live well.

839
00:41:34,960 --> 00:41:36,200
I promised Father,

840
00:41:36,440 --> 00:41:37,840
so I must do it.

841
00:41:38,560 --> 00:41:39,840
After he died?

842
00:41:40,320 --> 00:41:40,840
What?

843
00:41:41,040 --> 00:41:42,520
Did he tell you before he died?

844
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:45,040
How is that possible?

845
00:41:45,400 --> 00:41:46,480
It was that day,

846
00:41:46,720 --> 00:41:49,160
the night before Father went to the palace.

847
00:41:49,160 --> 00:41:50,160
Enough. Stop talking.

848
00:41:52,240 --> 00:41:53,840
It is late today.

849
00:41:53,960 --> 00:41:55,040
We should be leaving.

850
00:41:55,440 --> 00:41:57,200
Miss Gu, thank you again

851
00:41:57,200 --> 00:41:58,280
for helping me today.

852
00:42:00,760 --> 00:42:01,320
Wait.

853
00:42:09,160 --> 00:42:10,200
Why did you suddenly think

854
00:42:10,280 --> 00:42:12,120
of asking Miss Gu to visit Madam Nie?

855
00:42:13,960 --> 00:42:15,320
It was just a passing impulse.

856
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:18,120
We spoke a few words at Baoxiang Temple.

857
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:19,800
I suddenly felt

858
00:42:21,840 --> 00:42:23,200
she was a good choice.

859
00:42:24,800 --> 00:42:27,720
Miss Gu is indeed clever and bold.

860
00:42:29,640 --> 00:42:30,800
She can hold her own in trouble.

861
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:33,560
Mr. Chen.

862
00:42:34,280 --> 00:42:35,400
Miss Gu sent word.

863
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:36,800
She asks when you are free

864
00:42:36,960 --> 00:42:38,200
and wants to meet.

865
00:42:53,000 --> 00:42:54,240
Greetings, Mr. Chen.

866
00:42:56,840 --> 00:42:57,520
Rise.

867
00:42:58,760 --> 00:43:00,160
Why have you come to me?

868
00:43:00,200 --> 00:43:00,800
Speak.

869
00:43:04,680 --> 00:43:06,000
Mr. Jiang is not an outsider.

870
00:43:06,840 --> 00:43:08,280
Say what you need to say.

871
00:43:10,920 --> 00:43:12,320
I came to report back.

872
00:43:12,920 --> 00:43:13,920
The matter you entrusted to me

873
00:43:13,920 --> 00:43:14,960
has been completed.

874
00:43:15,840 --> 00:43:17,440
No wonder you would not appear yourself

875
00:43:17,800 --> 00:43:18,960
and sent me instead.

876
00:43:24,360 --> 00:43:26,280
You met Madam Nie and Xiangyun.

877
00:43:26,560 --> 00:43:27,840
I not only met them,

878
00:43:28,120 --> 00:43:28,840
I also

879
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:30,720
dealt with a pack of Nie clansmen.

880
00:43:32,200 --> 00:43:33,320
They forced Madam Nie

881
00:43:33,600 --> 00:43:34,440
